### 1. Health Check (Sistem Durumu)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Ortak varsayılanlar (kritik bina, %25 rezerv, eşikler)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/simulation/defaults

###

### 3. Hazır profil setleri
GET http://localhost:5000/api/simulation/data-summary

###

### 4. DB'den hazırlanan 24 saatlik Core Engine girdisi (önizleme)
# Önce veri yükleyin: npm run seed:dev (source=dev) veya npm run profiles:build (source=real)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/simulation/inputs?source=dev&criticalBuildings=LABORATORY,LIBRARY

###

### 5. Core Engine'de Basic vs Smart simülasyonu (Java servisi core_engine_queue'yu dinlemelidir)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/simulation/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batteryCapacityKwh": 100,
  "initialBatterySocKwh": 50,
  "criticalBuildings": ["LABORATORY"],
  "scenarioConditions": [
    { "type": "GRID_OUTAGE", "startHour": 18, "endHour": 20 }
  ],
  "smartStrategyConfig": {
    "minimumReservePercent": 25,
    "highPriceThreshold": 2.5,
    "outageLookAheadHours": 3
  },
  "source": "dev"
}

###

### 6. Geçmiş simülasyon çalıştırmaları
GET http://localhost:5000/api/simulation/runs?limit=10

###
